        <row id="SRegisterManually" changed="20250106T095608Z" si="24456" created="20250106T095608Z" codep="1">
          <value>Application can not register this COM object.
To register it manually run Command Prompt as administrator, go to application directory, and enter
%0:s %1:s</value>
          <lang id="fi" rw="0" ex="1" time="20251104T181535Z" fuzzy="99.5">Sovellus ei voi rekisteröidä tätä COM-objektia.
